        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────…………",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "……早上好。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦、哦，小糸！",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "啊……ぷ、制作人先生也在啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯……",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "小糸，好像没什么精神啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "……诶，啊，对、对不起……",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，没什么好道歉的……发生什么了吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "…………小、小测验发下来了。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "可是，答题卡好像错开了一格……",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……原来如此。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "我……明明全都得做好才行……",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "──比、比起这个……",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "ぷ、制作人先生才是，是不是没什么精神……！",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………──小糸，其实。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你上次参加的那场甄选，结果今天来了。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……这次，没能合格。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "啊…………这样、啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "那、那个……对不起，制作人先生。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "我、我，什么都没能做好呢……",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是，小糸没有错。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "小糸才刚开始做这份工作，不习惯的地方很多。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不只是工作，和学业兼顾也很辛苦，我却没能好好支援，抱歉。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……不过，一开始总是不顺利的，这是当然的。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "……那，总有一天会顺利吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "我，要到什么时候……",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "啊……对、对不起，不是那样……",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "诶、诶嘿嘿……真没用啊，我。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "──真是不顺利啊……",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "小糸才刚开始。",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "一起跨过去吧。",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          },
          {
            "label": "会顺利的。",
            "nextNodeId": "140"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "而且我作为制作人也还差得远。",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "制作人先生……",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "努力，然后不行的时候就像这样再聊聊。",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "…………！……好。"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "以后大概也会有什么都不顺利的日子。",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "…………是……",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "但就算那样，在那之后一定会有全部都顺利的日子。",
        "nextNodeId": "123"
      },
      "123": {
        "id": "123",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "一、一定……？",
        "nextNodeId": "124"
      },
      "124": {
        "id": "124",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，一定。"
      },
      "140": {
        "id": "140",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "小糸会顺利的。",
        "nextNodeId": "141"
      },
      "141": {
        "id": "141",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "……会吗……",
        "nextNodeId": "142"
      },
      "142": {
        "id": "142",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不顺利的那些也全都不会白费。",
        "nextNodeId": "143"
      },
      "143": {
        "id": "143",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "为了顺利，全都有用。"
      }
